1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,710
A square root (√)
is squaring backwards!

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,080
A square with an area of 25

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:10,250
How long is each side?

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,720
Since 5 × 5 = 25, each side is 5 (√25 = 5)

5
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,190
Squaring: side → area

6
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:20,260
Square root: area → side
It goes the other way

7
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:29,830
√ = look at the area, find the side

8
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:36,130
So what about a square with an area of 2?

9
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,880
NEXT: A square with an area of 2 — how long is each side?
